    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Requires Attunement</p><p><a href=\"https://amellwind-mh-dn-d5e-foundry-toolbox-2.vercel.app/weapons?weapon=Heavy+Bowgun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Heavy Bowgun in the Toolbox</a></p><p>Ammo DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Dexterity modifier</p><hr><h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature with this weapon and deal damage to it, you can reduce its Speed by 10 feet until the start of your next turn. If the creature is hit more than once by weapons that have this property, the Speed reduction doesn't exceed 10 feet.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Magazine</strong></p><p>The weapon holds a maximum of 4 loaded rounds at a time. When the magazine reaches 0, you must reload it before you can fire again.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Reload</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p><p>You can fully reload your magazine using an Action or a Bonus Action. When you do so, you choose the type of ammunition the weapon will contain.</p></div><h3>Ammunition</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Normal Ammo</strong></p><p>Deals the weapon's base damage ([[/r 1d10]] Piercing) to a single target.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<p>Requires Attunement</p><p>Ammo DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Dexterity modifier</p><hr><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Magazine</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Reload</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p></div>"
    },
